      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community sits at the junction of Farm Roads 193 and 264, about fifty miles northeast of Lubbock in northwestern Dickens County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
