      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1915 a one‑teacher Prairie View School was moved to McAdoo, reflecting the town’s early commitment to education.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/mcadoo-tx",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Near McAdoo, Invenergy LLC built a 150‑MW wind farm in 2008, featuring 100 GE 1.5‑MW turbines that now power local homes.",
